{
 "title": "HashMap 和 HashSet",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "`std.collections` 提供键 → 值字典 **`HashMap[K, V]`** 和无重复集合 **`HashSet[K]`**。`hashmap_new[K, V]()` 创建一个空字典；`insert` 添加，`get` 返回 `Optional`，`get_or` 给出默认值，`contains` 询问键是否存在，`len` 表示有多少个。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "import std.collections",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    ages = collections.hashmap_new[str, i32]()",
    "    ages.insert(\"ali\", 30)",
    "    ages.insert(\"ayse\", 25)",
    "    print(ages.len())",
    "    print(ages.get_or(\"ali\", 0))",
    "    print(ages.contains(\"zeynep\"))",
    "    match ages.get(\"ayse\"):",
    "        Valid(a):",
    "            print(\"ayse is\", a)",
    "        None:",
    "            print(\"not found\")"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "2",
    "30",
    "false",
    "ayse is 25"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "import std.collections",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    seen = collections.hashset_new[i32]()",
    "    print(seen.insert(3))",
    "    print(seen.insert(7))",
    "    print(seen.insert(3))",
    "    print(seen.len(), seen.contains(7))"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "true",
    "true",
    "false",
    "2 true"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "如果键是新的，`HashSet.insert` 返回 `true`；如果已存在，返回 `false`；这对找出重复项很方便。"
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c10-l03-x1",
   "prompt": "用 `HashMap[str, i32]` 统计单词 `\"a\"`、`\"b\"`、`\"a\"`、`\"c\"`、`\"b\"`、`\"a\"` 各出现多少次，并输出 `\"a\"` 的计数。",
   "starter": [
    "import std.collections",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    words: [6]str = [\"a\", \"b\", \"a\", \"c\", \"b\", \"a\"]",
    "    counts = collections.hashmap_new[str, i32]()",
    "    print(counts.get_or(\"a\", 0))"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "import std.collections",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    words: [6]str = [\"a\", \"b\", \"a\", \"c\", \"b\", \"a\"]",
    "    counts = collections.hashmap_new[str, i32]()",
    "    for w in words:",
    "        counts.insert(w, counts.get_or(w, 0) + 1)",
    "    print(counts.get_or(\"a\", 0))"
   ],
   "hint": "对每个单词执行 `counts.insert(w, counts.get_or(w, 0) + 1)`。",
   "expected": [
    "3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c10-l03-q1",
   "q": "当键不存在时，`get_or(key, 0)` 给出什么？",
   "options": [
    "一个错误",
    "0（给定的默认值）",
    "`None`"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "`get_or` 接收一个默认值；`get` 返回 `Optional`。"
  }
 ]
}
